# Privacy and PII

## Sensitive data locations

- `data/catalog/inbox_*.yaml` — scraped subjects, senders, previews (PII)
- `config.json` — client names, 340B IDs
- Graph message content when `EMAIL_BACKEND=graph`
- LLM prompts when `CLASSIFIER_MODE=llm` or `RESPONDER_MODE=llm` (local Ollama)

## Safe defaults

- Tests: synthetic fixtures only
- Tokens: outside repo in MSAL cache
- Studio: localhost by default
- Sending: drafts only, `AUTO_SEND_MODE=off`

## Before committing catalog changes

- Review for unnecessary email content
- Use `@privacy-agent` for large catalog diffs
- Never commit `.env` or token files
